3 py-4 text-sm text-gray-500\">Brazing and welding per joint by certified welders.</td>\n                                        <td class=\"whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-4 text-sm text-gray-500\">Starts from ₹500/joint*</td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                    <tr>\n                                        <td class=\"whitespace-nowrap py-4 pl-4 pr-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 sm:pl-6\">Oxygen Pipeline Testing Vadodara</td>\n                                        <td class=\"px-3 py-4 text-sm text-gray-500\">Pressure testing, leak detection, and certification.</td>\n                                        <td class=\"whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-4 text-sm text-gray-500\">Starts from ₹5,000*</td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                     <tr>\n                                        <td class=\"whitespace-nowrap py-4 pl-4 pr-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 sm:pl-6\">Emergency Repair Call-out</td>\n                                        <td class=\"px-3 py-4 text-sm text-gray-500\">Includes initial diagnosis for Oxygen Pipeline Repair Vadodara.</td>\n                                        <td class=\"whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-4 text-sm text-gray-500\">₹1,500 (Inspection) + Parts &#038; Labor</td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                     <tr>\n                                        <td class=\"whitespace-nowrap py-4 pl-4 pr-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 sm:pl-6\">Annual Maintenance Contract (AMC)</td>\n                                        <td class=\"px-3 py-4 text-sm text-gray-500\">Comprehensive yearly check-up for Medical Gas Pipeline Maintenance Vadodara.</td>\n                                        <td class=\"whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-4 text-sm text-gray-500\">Contact for Custom Quote</td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                </tbody>\n                            </table>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mt-4 text-center\">*Prices are indicative and may vary based on site conditions, pipe diameter, and project complexity. GST extra as applicable. Contact us for a precise quote.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- FAQ Section -->\n        <section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-16\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n                <div class=\"text-center\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl section-title\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-xl text-gray-600\">Have questions? We have answers. Here&#8217;s what our clients often ask.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-12 space-y-4\">\n                    <details class=\"faq-item p-4 border rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm\">\n                        <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-gray-800\">\n                            Why is copper piping essential for medical and industrial oxygen?\n                            <span class=\"faq-arrow transform transition-transform duration-300\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg>\n                            </span>\n                        </summary>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600\">\n                            Copper piping is critical because it is non-reactive with oxygen, preventing contamination and ensuring purity. Its antimicrobial properties make it ideal for Copper Piping for Healthcare Facilities Vadodara. For industrial uses, it withstands high-pressure copper gas piping in Vadodara safely.\n                        </p>\n                    </details>\n                    <details class=\"faq-item p-4 border rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm\">\n                        <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-gray-800\">\n                            What areas do you serve besides Vadodara?\n                            <span class=\"faq-arrow transform transition-transform duration-300\">\n                                <svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg>\n                            </span>\n                        </summary>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600\">\n                            We serve all major cities and GIDCs across Gujarat, including Ahmedabad, Surat, Rajkot, and more. We are one of the most trusted Gas Pipeline Fabricators in Gujarat.\n                        </p>\n                    </details>\n                     <details class=\"faq-item p-4 border rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm\">\n                        <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-gray-800\">Why is copper used for medical oxygen pipelines?</summary>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600\">Copper is the preferred material for medical oxygen pipelines due to its antimicrobial properties, high corrosion resistance, and excellent durability. It ensures the purity of the oxygen being delivered, which is critical in healthcare settings. We use only medical grade copper pipe for oxygen in Vadodara.</p>\n                    </details>\n                    <details class=\"faq-item p-4 border rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm\">\n                        <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-gray-800\">What is the cost of oxygen pipeline installation in Vadodara?</summary>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600\">The cost of oxygen pipeline installation in Vadodara varies based on the length of the pipeline, complexity of the installation, type of facility (hospital vs. industrial), and specific components required. Atlas Aircon provides a transparent, detailed quote after a free site survey. Contact us for an accurate estimate.</p>\n                    </details>\n                    <details class=\"faq-item p-4 border rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm\">\n                        <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-gray-800\">Do you provide services in industrial areas like GIDCs?</summary>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600\">Yes, we are experts in Industrial oxygen pipeline Vadodara. We serve all major GIDCs including Makarpura GIDC, Nandesari GIDC, Waghodia GIDC, and Savli (Manjusar) GIDC. We handle high-pressure copper gas piping in Vadodara for various industrial applications.</p>\n                    </details>\n                    <details class=\"faq-item p-4 border rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm\">\n                        <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-gray-800\">How quickly can you respond to an emergency repair call?</summary>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600\">We offer 24/7 emergency Oxygen Pipeline Repair Vadodara. Our rapid response team aims to be on-site as quickly as possible, typically within a few hours, to minimize downtime and ensure safety.</p>\n                    </details>\n                    <details class=\"faq-item p-4 border rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm\">\n                        <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-gray-800\">Are your technicians certified for medical gas pipeline installation?</summary>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600\">Absolutely. All our technicians are highly trained and certified for Medical Gas Pipeline Installation Vadodara. They adhere to the strictest safety and quality standards for Indian hospitals.</p>\n                    </details>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Final CTA / Contact Section -->\n        <section id=\"contact\" class=\"silver-black-bg\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:py-24 lg:px-8 lg:flex lg:items-center lg:justify-between\">\n                <div class=\"lg:w-0 lg:flex-1\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl\">Ready for a Reliable Oxygen Pipeline Solution?</h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg text-gray-300\">\n                        Don&#8217;t compromise on safety and quality. Whether it&#8217;s a new Hospital Oxygen Pipeline Installation Vadodara or urgent repairs, our team is ready to deliver. Contact the experts at Atlas Aircon today for a free consultation and quote.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-8 flex space-x-6\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/atlasaircon20\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-gray-300 hover:text-white\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                            <span class=\"sr-only\">Facebook</span>\n                            <svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M22 12c0-5.523-4.477-10-10-10S2 6.477 2 12c0 4.991 3.657 9.128 8.438 9.878v-6.987h-2.54V12h2.54V9.797c0-2.506 1.492-3.89 3.777-3.89 1.094 0 2.238.195 2.238.195v2.46h-1.26c-1.243 0-1.63.771-1.63 1.562V12h2.773l-.443 2.89h-2.33v6.988C18.343 21.128 22 16.991 22 12z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" /></svg>\n                        </a>\n                         <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://g.co/kgs/xT5P1XM\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-gray-300 hover:text-white\">\n                            <span class=\"sr-only\">Google</span>\n                            <svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 